    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d138-a2">

                <pb facs="0144" n="138" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg138"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Communications</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December ,
                        1893.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the Governors of Territories,
                        Imperial Municipalities, and Prefecture upon the Seaboard:</hi></p>
                <p>I am instructed to inform you that an agreement has been concluded between Great
                    Britain and the United States concerning fishing in Bering Sea, and that report
                    has reached here that since Japan is not a party thereto, and not bound thereby,
                    some attempts were likely to be made to have vessels belonging to nationals of
                    both countries registered under the names of Japanese and fly the Japanese flag
                    for the purpose of following the pursuit of fishing in Bering Sea.</p>
                <p>As the control of fishing by the different countries has become strict, no doubt
                    these designing schemes are contrived to evade the law. In cases, therefore, of
                    the purchase of foreign vessels, if the transfer of registration is requested,
                    you are, upon strict examination, to act in the matter so that no such
                    malfeasance as the above may arise.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Saito Hide-Aki</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chief of the Marine Bureau.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
